    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered which country gets the most rain? Which was the first ever land animal on Earth? Which country has more pyramids than Egypt? Or which country has the tallest people? Learn all of this and much more in Quiz &amp; Learn: Geography. Test your knowledge to unlock photo rounds that contain amazing facts. You will definitely learn something you never knew! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 multiple choice questions of varying difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit to answer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 rounds that test your knowledge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 rounds with amazing facts about geography illustrated with photographs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing soundtrack with 7 different tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Steam achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered which country gets the most rain? Which was the first ever land animal on Earth? Which country has more pyramids than Egypt? Or which country has the tallest people? Learn all of this and much more in Quiz &amp; Learn: Geography. Test your knowledge to unlock photo rounds that contain amazing facts. You will definitely learn something you never knew! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 multiple choice questions of varying difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit to answer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 rounds that test your knowledge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 rounds with amazing facts about geography illustrated with photographs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing soundtrack with 7 different tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 Steam achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
